    <briefdescription>
<para>Gauss-Hyperbolic integration. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class performs a 1-dimensional Gauss-Hyperbolic integration. <formula id="193">\[ \int_{-\inf}^{\inf} f(x) \mathrm{d}x \]</formula> The weighting function is <formula id="198">\[ w(x)=1/cosh(x) \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
